  "description": "**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Naver Webtoon](https://comic.naver.com/webtoon/list?titleId=819716), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=10584252)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[Japanese](https://manga.line.me/product/periodic?id=Z0003491)\n\nTwenty-year-old So-Yoon, the pain of separation that came with graduating from high school is fleeting ! First college friends, seniors. First food, first place to visit. First love, first excitement. For all the firsts that I will write anew. So-Yoon's campus romance that is timid but says everything she wants to say !",
